    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Mechanical engineer, energy coordinator and a mother, Sana Wasi, is the only woman engineer in the mechanical, electrical and plumbing department at AKU. She is one of the many hidden heroes that have been working behind the scenes in the fight against COVID-19.",
